{"unit_id":"398894496-arch__KRouter#feature-01","repo":"398894496-arch/KRouter","commit":"e9346963eca848a5012406ea5cb2f0cacc55fbb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**KRouter** 的功能「DSH 路由工具」：注册七个只读工具，查询状态、偏好、更正、记忆、项目和全库内容，也可请求别名建议。状态工具无需 query，其余接收短 query。","source":"generated","evidence":["extras/dsh/lib/register.js:41-117"]}
